        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-06-06T20:21:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We don't know a lot about Muse's capabilities.&nbsp; She's almost certainly a \"minion master\" archetype, but whether she has psychic abilities beyond that we don't know.&nbsp; In the card game she deals psychic damage, but whether she can read minds, move objects, or any of Visionary's other stunts is unknown.&nbsp; There could be a more traditional mentalist, perhaps much like Highbrow with the \"analyst\" emphasis.</p>",
